# Keep the worker image small and free of secrets (apps/worker/Dockerfile builds from the root).
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.next
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.log
# The dashboard isn't built here; only its package.json is kept so the lockfile still matches.
apps/dashboard/*
!apps/dashboard/package.json
supabase
Workflow
